/parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Pharmaceutically acceptable salts of 2-methyl-3-butenyl-1-pyrophosphoric acid; agents for treating lymphocytes containing at least one member selected from among 2-methyl-3-butenyl-1-pyrophosphoric acid, pharmaceutically acceptable salts thereof and/or hydrates of the same; V gamma 2V delta 2 T cells treated by these agents; and drugs containing the same.  These substances can specifically stimulate and proliferate V gamma 2V delta 2 T cells and, at the same time, induce and enhance the antitumor effect thereof.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur des sels pharmaceutiquement acceptables de l'acide 2-méthyl-3-butényl-1-pyrophosphorique ; sur des agents de traitement des lymphocytes contenant au moins un élément sélectionné dans l'acide 2-méthyl-3-butényl-1-pyrophosphorique, sur leurs sels pharmaceutiquement acceptables et/ou des hydrates de ceux-ci. L'invention porte également sur les lymphocytes T V gamma 2V delta 2 traités par ces agents, et sur des médicaments les contenant. Ces substances peuvent stimuler et faire proliférer de manière spécifique les lymphocytes T V gamma 2V delta 2 et, en même temps, induire et améliorer leur effet antitumoral.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>